    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.biovat.tooltip=Machine Type: §eBacterial Vat, Bac Vat§r\n§bAdvanced Bio Processing\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nSome recipes require §aR§2A§aD§2I§aA§2T§aI§2O§aN§7 supplied with a §l§aRadio Hatch\nRadiation can be either a minimum requirement or an exact value\nEfficiency depends on Output Hatch fluid level\nEfficiency peaks at §d50%\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.biovat.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §65§7x§65§7x§64§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §619-45 §fStainless Steel Machine Casing\n   §632 §fAny Tiered Glass §b(Tiered)\n   §e0-1 §fRadio Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1+ §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e0+ §fInput Bus: §7Any casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e0+ §fOutput Bus: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fOutput Hatch: §7Any casing\n   \nSubchannel §bglass§7 determines §bGlass Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
