    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.manualtrafo.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §63§7x§63§7x§63-10§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §60+ §fMV Machine Casing\n   §fTransformer-Winding Block: §71 Layer for each tier transformed\n   §fNickel-Zinc-Ferrite Block: §7Middle of Transformer-Winding Block\n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Any bottom layer Casing\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Any bottom layer Casing\n§f   Dynamo Hatch: §7Any top layer Casing\n   \n   Tapped Mode :\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Touching Transformer-Winding Block\n§f   Dynamo Hatch: §7Touching Transformer-Winding Block\n   Hatches touching Transformer-Winding Block must be tiered from bottom to top\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
