    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.blackholecompressor.tooltip=Machine Type: §eCompressor, Advanced Neutronium Compressor, BHC§r\n§dUses the immense power of the event horizon to compress things\n§dNo longer requires heat management to perform superdense compression\n§dCan create advanced singularities!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nInsert a §fBlack Hole Seed§7 to open a black hole\nThe black hole will begin its life at §c100§7 stability and slowly decay\nStability decays by §c1/s§7 until it reaches 0\nAt 0 stability, the black hole is §4UNSTABLE\nOnce the black hole becomes unstable, it will void recipes and eventually close itself!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nThe decay can be §lhalted§r§7 by inserting 1 L/s of spacetime into specific hatches\nEvery §c30§7 total seconds saved by spacetime insertion will §cdouble§7 the cost per second!\nInsert a §fBlack Hole Collapser§7 to close the black hole\nTo restore stability and reset spacetime costs, close the black hole and open a new one\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§fUse circuit 20 for Compressor and 21 for Neutronium Compressor\n§68§7 Parallels per §fVoltage§7 Tier\n§a500%§7 Speed\n§b70%§7 EU Usage\n§c2x/4x§7 parallels when stability is BELOW §c50/20\nBelow §c20§7 stability, parallels are §cuncapped§7 for recipes that do not require a black hole.\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§cRecipe tier is limited to hatch tier + 1. Will not perform overclocks above the hatch tier\n§cLimited to one energy hatch if using a Multi-Amp or Laser hatch\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nAdded by: §a§a§lOllie§r§7 & §aBucketBrigade§r§7
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.blackholecompressor.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §635§7x§633§7x§635§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Middle of structure, 6th layer\n   §63667-3671 §fExtreme Density Space-Bending Casing\n   §6950-985 §fBackground Radiation Absorbent Casing\n   §6144 §fNaquadah Alloy Frame Box\n   §664 §fHawking Radiation Realignment Focus\n   §e0+ §fBlack Hole Utility Hatch: §7Any absorbent casing\n   §e1+ §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any absorbent casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Bus/Hatch: §7Any absorbent casing (inputs), the casing behind each laser (spacetime)\n   §e1+ §fOutput Bus: §7Any absorbent casing\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.blastfurnace.tooltip=Machine Type: §eBlast Furnace, EBF§r\nYou can use some fluids to reduce recipe time. Place the circuit in the Input Bus\nIncreases Heat by §c100K§7 for every §fVoltage§7 tier past §bMV\nReduces §bEU Usage§7 by §f5%§7 every §c900K§7 above the recipe requirement\nEvery §c1800K§7 over the recipe requirement grants 1 §dPerfect Overclock\nThat means the EBF will reduce recipe time by a factor 4 instead of 2 (giving 100% efficiency)\n§5400 §7Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.blastfurnace.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §63§7x§63§7x§64§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §616 §fHeating Coil §b(Tiered)\n   §60-12 §fHeat Proof Machine Casing\n   §e1+ §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any bottom casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any bottom casing\n   §e1 §fMuffler Hatch: §7Top center casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Bus/Hatch: §7Any bottom casing\n   §e1+ §fOutput Bus/Hatch: §7Any bottom casing for solids/liquids, any top casing for gases\n   §fMandatory Air: §7Interior of the structure\n   \nSubchannel §bcoil§7 determines §bHeating Coil Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.boiler.bronze.tooltip=Machine Type: §eBoiler§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nProduces 32,000L of Steam with 1 Coal at 16,000L/s\nA programmed circuit in the main block throttles the boiler (-1000L/s per config)\nSolid Fuels with a burn value that is too high or too low will not work\nDiesel fuels have 1/4 efficiency - Takes 31.25 seconds to heat up\n§5200 §7Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
