    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.chemicalreactor.tooltip=Machine Type: §eChemical Reactor, LCR§r\nAccepts fluids instead of fluid cells\nCan perform several direct recipes that skip intermediate compounds\n§bMachine does not lose efficiency when overclocked\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
