    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.heatexchanger.tooltip=Machine Type: §eHeat Exchanger, LHE§r\nInputs are §cLava§7, §cHot Coolant§7, or §cHot Solar Salt\nOutputs are §9Pahoehoe Lava§7, §9IC2 Coolant§7, or §9Cold Solar Salt\nConverts distilled water into §rSteam§7 or §rSH Steam§7 in the process\nOutputs §rSH Steam§7 if the input rate of hot fluid is above a certain §dthreshold\nExplodes after 100s if it runs out of distilled water\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§cLava§7 | SH Threshold §d1,000 L/s§7 | Max Input §c2,000 L/s§7 | Max Output §r8,000 L/t SH Steam\n§cHot Coolant§7 | SH Threshold §d800 L/s§7 | Max Input §c1,600 L/s§7 | Max Output §r16,000 L/t SH Steam\n§cHot Solar Salt§7 | SH Threshold §d160 L/s§7 | Max Input §c320 L/s§7 | Max Output §r16,000 L/t SH Steam\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nA circuit in the controller lowers the SH threshold at the cost of steam\n§d-3.75%§7 SH Threshold and §r-1.5%§7 steam output per circuit over 1\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
