    S:gt.blockmachines.supercriticalsteamturbine.tooltip=Machine Type: §eSteam Turbine, LST-SC§r\nNeeds a Turbine, place inside controller\nGenerates power from Supercritical (SC) Steam based on the turbine and fitting\nOutputs 1L of Superheated (SH) Steam for every 1L of Supercritical Steam\nUse a screwdriver to adjust the fitting of the turbine\nLoose fit increases flow in exchange for efficiency\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nStructure by: §a§6hugetrust§r§7
    S:gt.blockmachines.supercriticalsteamturbine.tooltip.32016=Machine Type: §eSteam Turbine, LST-SC§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nNeeds a Turbine, place inside controller\nUse Supercritical Steam to generate power\nOutputs 1L of SH Steam per 1L of SC Steam as well as producing power\nPower output depends on turbine and fitting\nUse screwdriver to adjust fitting of turbine\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.supercriticalsteamturbine.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §66§7x§63§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 2nd layer\n   §614 §fPBI Frame Box\n   §68-14 §fSC Turbine Casing\n   §612 §fPBI Pipe Casing\n   §e1 §fDynamo Hatch: §7Back center turbine casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any back turbine casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Hatch: §7Any back turbine casing\n   §e0+ §fOutput Hatch: §7Any back turbine casing\n   §fMandatory Air: §73x3 area in front of controller\n   \n§cDynamo cannot be greater than 4A\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
